    "problems": "The scaling sweep covers only 700M to 3B parameters and does not fit or evaluate a power law. The reported size-sweep outcomes are FVD rather than held-out loss. Validation-loss figures have no numeric values in the text, and no uncertainty values are reported for the listed FVD results.",
    "rows_left_out": "Cited results from prior work and comparisons in Table 2 that are not the authors' own model results were left out. Inference speed and token counts were not recorded because they do not measure the claim versions.",
    "untested": [
