    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "The relation is changed from 'tests'/T3 to uses_without_test/T4. The paper invokes LLM scalability only as motivation, and its 'scalability' evidence is three model sizes of its own method evaluated by FVD. Depth and width co-vary with size (Table 4: 24/24/32 layers), so V4 cannot be probed. Training epochs differ between Table 1 (20 epochs) and Table 2 (77 epochs on K600), which explains the different FVDs for the same 700M model."
